<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-11-08T23:50:40.077Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 23:50:40 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai air force scrambled F-16 fighters near the Tak border in response to attacks spilling over from Myanmar, while KNU-PDF forces fired into Thailand as a tactical move. Malaysian authorities tightened border security in Kelantan to curb migrant smuggling linked to the same regional tension. In Thailand, a vehicle collision in Surin killed six people and injured one, and a lightning strike in Chiang Mai killed one person and wounded eight. The government announced a safety group to manage Chinese arrivals and advanced rail connections with Laos and China. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNNVhfZWlHWnVfYTJic3BJUFVEdEc4dk5NNDNPckdOdVBTUzRTcGxPRDdLVXNzTmE0NDdScHVjUTlJd2tVVl9pVFp6WHBWV1ZQYzczeEZxZ1Nncl9tcG9Tcm05ZWdleVU1RkRINW80cmRrTjgzYXpnNUNsS1RnUVRKTzROWkNIRTVuamF3V1F0V0J3LXM2MjByUFFVNjZ3UkpBZkFKNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxQVGY3V1JheS11SDkwdUM3bXZkMGVLQlV1ajFxY3BMSnMxekdPNXdGU2F3MU5lQW1seTJhYjlwZEgybkVNa1IwbUdBYTZkZjlYa0pyU0pGRUV4OEhjT01feE9SOU9aSEdZcVdwQ0lGbEQ0OEpWeHVwSTl0N3gtSEthUEt6dE40bUMzMXJmZ0p3N3pIdEZyb2ZVd21uSlFNUTMxZTUtbmRqYmVRX3hoNy1JVzdERk9yMmRJNU9kaDFkclRieFlWTG9HYg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pattaya Mail&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOb2ZJV3ctVC1RcExuVkkxWnBzMWhtdEgwTC1MYkVYZHRuNUJqQktvYkdOVFdEU3lrNmhNWlk0M2FINlhNOFhid0tFS1l1N0hma3ZlaFF6cmFpTkxLdmplY25MWXRpZ3E4Yl9sZ0ctb2Z0RjBRc2NEVEF6RWw0QjBWRmJtSEllTms0TGhIRUh2SzJNZF83SnZMVUZHNnQwaVNjelNtS3VwNlRlVzNNYkRYR2VpNmw?oc=5&quot;&gt;dailyasianage.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxOdVEwb0xZZnUxQXhvY1p5alYwZDgyYlJaeDJLbUlJVXFoSXlFU3hubDN5a1Z3akcxek1fNnkzOGZqRXNPNVBiLVlVSUctM181VVVSenV